---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (Legion Sale Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_check_stage: authorized
    q_check_auth --> q_revert: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_stage --> q_check_from: valid stage for transfer
    q_check_stage --> q_revert: revert InvalidStage
    q_check_from --> q_check_to: fromInvestor has active position
    q_check_from --> q_revert: revert NoPosition
    q_check_to --> q_transfer_position: toInvestor is valid address
    q_check_to --> q_revert: revert InvalidAddress
    q_transfer_position --> q_clear_from: copy position data from -> to
    q_clear_from --> [*]: clear fromInvestor position, emit PositionTransferred
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_transfer_position
        INV-001: only Legion operators can execute direct transfers
        INV-002: entire position is transferred atomically
        INV-003: fromInvestor position is fully cleared after transfer
    end note
